      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14224812/assets/120d58ea1e9174a4304007c89b5de1c2f12b1312b89091d30a8b7929d6288092.png)\n\nThe polygon shown above is reflected across the line ${l}_{1}$ and then this resulting polygon is reflected across the line ${l}_{2}.$ Which of the following diagrams shows the final polygon?",
      "worked_solution": "First, we reflect our figure in the line ${l}_{1}:$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14224812/assets/0b45d1a40068be7ed1e24c79308560d5c2d19f609eec5dedcae6665046b61991.png)\n\nNow, we reflect the resulting figure in the line ${l}_{2}:$ \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14224812/assets/75a215a1e852b5fa536cd305d917d2a1e6da1f7569872b9638474111a2691dd9.png)",
